# This repo hosts public-facing assets ONLY:
#   - themes/   BetterDiscord theme CSS + supporting images/SVGs/GIFs
#   - assets/   Misc image assets referenced from theme/CSS imports
#   - README + .gitattributes
#
# Everything else (plugin source, build tooling, internal docs, Claude
# config, repo memory, lint reports, etc.) is dev-only and intentionally
# excluded so the public mirror stays small and leak-free.
#
# Strategy: allowlist. Block everything at the root by default, then
# explicitly re-allow the handful of intentionally-public paths.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1) Block every top-level entry by default
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2) Re-allow only the intentionally-public paths
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/themes/
!/assets/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3) Inside themes/ — exclude personal / backup / migration noise
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
themes/backups/
themes/**/backups/
themes/*.bak
themes/MyTheme.theme.css
themes/organized/
themes/MIGRATION-GUIDE.md
themes/migrate-to-modular.sh

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4) Sensitive data — defense in depth (already covered by /* but
#    keep explicit so a future change to allowlist can't leak)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.env
shadow-away.env
*.key
*.pem
*.cert
secrets/
credentials/
config.local.*

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5) OS / IDE files (defense in depth)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-*
*.code-workspace
